  "aartiGaneshLyricsFull": "Sukhkarta Dukhharta Varta Vighnachi.\nNuravi Puravi Prem Krupa Jayachi.\nSarvangi Sundar Uti Shendurachi.\nKanthi Jhalke Maal Muktafalanchi.\n\nJai Dev Jai Dev Jai Mangalmurti.\nDarshanmatre Manokamna Purti.",
  "aartiGaneshMeaning": "This aarti is dedicated to Lord Ganesha.\nHe removes obstacles, grants joy and fulfills the wishes of devotees.",
  "aartiGaneshInfo": "Shri Ganpati Aarti is one of the most loved aartis in Maharashtra, sung during daily worship and festivals.",
  "aartiVitthalLyricsFull": "Yei Ho Vitthale Majhe Mauli.\nTujiya Darshanala Talmalate Kaya.\nPanduranga Panduranga Vitthal Nama.\nBhaktanche Kaivari Shri Pandurang Rama.",
  "aartiVitthalMeaning": "This aarti praises Lord Vitthal of Pandharpur.\nDevotees long for his darshan and chant his name.",
  "aartiVitthalInfo": "Vitthal Aarti is central to the Warkari tradition, especially on Ashadhi and Kartiki Ekadashi.",
  "aartiDurgaLyricsFull": "Durge Durghat Bhari Tujvin Sansari.\nAnathanathi Tuchi Bhavani.\nVari Vari Janmamaranachi Vari.\nHaraviti Davisi Purusharth Shariri.",
  "aartiDurgaMeaning": "This aarti is offered to Goddess Durga.\nMother Bhavani protects devotees and gives them strength.",
  "aartiDurgaInfo": "Durga Aarti is sung during Navratri and Devi puja.",
  "aartiShivaLyricsFull": "Om Jai Shiv Omkara, Swami Jai Shiv Omkara.\nBrahma Vishnu Sadashiv Ardhangi Dhara.",
